<BaseLayout title="Troubleshooting — Ferrite docs" description="Verification, repair, logs and diagnostics in Ferrite.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Docs / Troubleshooting</div><h1>Make the next failure useful.</h1><p>Ferrite's diagnostics tools are designed to turn a vague launch problem into evidence you can inspect or share.</p></div></section>
  <div class="container prose"><h2>Verify, then repair</h2><p>Instance verification checks managed artifacts against their published digests. Repair re-acquires damaged files rather than silently replacing healthy content.</p><h2>Logs and support bundles</h2><p>Inspect launcher output and crash reports, then export a redacted support bundle containing the relevant operation history and platform information. Review the bundle before sharing it.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
